{"chosen":"{\"candidate_id\":\"c20995\",\"claimed_after\":{\"fuel\":12,\"node\":\"Fjord\"},\"plan\":[]}","prompt":"Select the better submitted candidate using the explicit ranking policy. Each candidate starts at world's start with world's initial fuel. A directed move is legal iff its edge exists and cost is at most remaining fuel. On an illegal action, stop and retain the prior state. A candidate is valid iff its entire plan is legal. A claim is correct iff claimed_after equals the executed final state. Goal achievement requires validity and terminal node=goal. remaining_moves is the minimum number of feasible moves to goal from terminal state/fuel, or null if unreachable. Initial distance is the same minimum from the initial state. progress is initial distance minus remaining distance for valid candidates with both finite, otherwise null. usefulness=-1 for invalid, 2 for valid goal-reaching, 1 for valid positive progress, 0 otherwise. Rank descending by (valid AND claim_correct, reaches_goal, usefulness, -remaining_moves, -full_submitted_plan_length). Null distance is worse than finite; true sorts above false. Return exactly the selected candidate object, including candidate_id, plan and claimed_after. Options have no quality order.\nWorld and response options JSON:\n{\"options\":[{\"candidate_id\":\"c20995\",\"claimed_after\":{\"fuel\":12,\"node\":\"Fjord\"},\"plan\":[]},{\"candidate_id\":\"c80251\",\"claimed_after\":{\"fuel\":12,\"node\":\"Beryl\"},\"plan\":[\"Beryl\"]}],\"world\":{\"edges\":[[\"Fjord\",\"Beryl\",2],[\"Beryl\",\"Dune\",3],[\"Beryl\",\"Fjord\",1]],\"fuel\":12,\"goal\":\"Dune\",\"kind\":\"graph\",\"nodes\":[\"Fjord\",\"Beryl\",\"Dune\"],\"plan\":[],\"start\":\"Fjord\"}}","rejected":"{\"candidate_id\":\"c80251\",\"claimed_after\":{\"fuel\":12,\"node\":\"Beryl\"},\"plan\":[\"Beryl\"]}"}
